{{!
    @template local_vravatar/designer

    The "My VR avatar" designer: a 3D preview and the choices as labelled radio groups and
    checkboxes under five headings (head and face, hair, body, costume, extras), the costumes as a
    wrapping grid of thumbnails by category, and the credits of the costume models. Without
    JavaScript the form posts to the page; with it, local_vravatar/designer saves through the web
    service, draws the preview (loading the costume models named by the data-model attributes) and
    shows the Reset, zoom (a toggle button, aria-pressed) and camera preview buttons.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none (data-region and data-action attributes)

    Context variables required for this template:
    * actionurl - where the form posts without JavaScript
    * sesskey - session key
    * sections - list of sections, each with id, heading, isextras and items; an item is either
      a radio group (radio: name, id, legend, isswatch and options, each option with value, id,
      label, checked, swatch, palette, model and credit), a checkbox (check: name, id, groupid,
      legend, label and checked) or the costume picker (costume: name, id, legend, none with value,
      id, label and checked, and categories, each with id, legend and options, each option with
      value, id, label, checked, thumb, model, credit and kind); the section with isextras also
      shows the glasses and picture checkboxes
    * glasses - whether glasses are chosen
    * picture - whether the profile picture is chosen
    * pictureallowed - whether the site allows profile pictures on avatars
    * haspicture - whether the user has a profile picture to show
    * hasdesign - whether the user has saved a design
    * hascredits - whether there are costume credits to list
    * credits - the costume models' credits, each with name, title, credit and source (all
      costumes, whatever their licence)

    The example below never has two closing braces next to each other: they would end this
    comment early.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "actionurl": "https://example.org/local/vravatar/index.php",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "sections": [
            {
                "id": "local-vravatar-section-head",
                "heading": "Head and face",
                "isextras": false,
                "items": [
                    {
                        "radio": {
                            "name": "skin",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-group-skin",
                            "legend": "Skin tone",
                            "isswatch": true,
                            "options": [
                                {
                                    "value": "match",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-skin-match",
                                    "label": "Same as body colour",
                                    "checked": true,
                                    "swatch": "",
                                    "palette": "skin"
                                },
                                {
                                    "value": "medium",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-skin-medium",
                                    "label": "Medium",
                                    "checked": false,
                                    "swatch": "#c98e64",
                                    "palette": "skin"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "check": {
                            "name": "ears",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-ears",
                            "groupid": "local-vravatar-group-ears",
                            "legend": "Ears",
                            "label": "Show ears",
                            "checked": false
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "id": "local-vravatar-section-extras",
                "heading": "Extras",
                "isextras": true,
                "items": [
                    {
                        "radio": {
                            "name": "hat",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-group-hat",
                            "legend": "Hat",
                            "isswatch": false,
                            "options": [
                                {
                                    "value": "none",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-hat-none",
                                    "label": "No hat",
                                    "checked": true,
                                    "swatch": "",
                                    "palette": "",
                                    "model": "",
                                    "credit": ""
                                },
                                {
                                    "value": "pirate",
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-hat-pirate",
                                    "label": "Pirate hat",
                                    "checked": false,
                                    "swatch": "",
                                    "palette": "",
                                    "model": "https://example.org/local/vravatar/costumes/hat-pirate.glb",
                                    "credit": "by Poly by Google, CC BY 3.0"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "id": "local-vravatar-section-costume",
                "heading": "Costume",
                "isextras": false,
                "items": [
                    {
                        "costume": {
                            "name": "outfit",
                            "id": "local-vravatar-group-outfit",
                            "legend": "Costume",
                            "none": {
                                "value": "none",
                                "id": "local-vravatar-outfit-none",
                                "label": "No costume",
                                "checked": true
                            },
                            "categories": [
                                {
                                    "id": "local-vravatar-costumes-suit",
                                    "legend": "Suits",
                                    "options": [
                                        {
                                            "value": "suit-tie",
                                            "id": "local-vravatar-outfit-suit-tie",
                                            "label": "Suit and tie",
                                            "checked": false,
                                            "thumb": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/local_vravatar/1/costumes/suit-tie",
                                            "model": "https://example.org/local/vravatar/costumes/suit-tie.glb",
                                            "credit": "by Ian MacGillivray, CC BY 3.0",
                                            "kind": "body"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "glasses": false,
        "picture": true,
        "pictureallowed": true,
        "haspicture": true,
        "hasdesign": true,
        "hascredits": true,
        "credits": [
            {
                "name": "Suit and tie",
                "title": "Suit & Tie Guy",
                "credit": "by Ian MacGillivray, CC BY 3.0",
                "source": "https://poly.pizza/m/cgdjE3cst7f"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="local-vravatar" data-region="local-vravatar-designer">
    <p>{{#str}}intro, local_vravatar{{/str}}</p>
    <p>{{#str}}whosees, local_vravatar{{/str}}</p>
    {{^hasdesign}}
        <div class="alert alert-info" data-region="nodesign">{{#str}}nodesign, local_vravatar{{/str}}</div>
    {{/hasdesign}}

    <div class="local-vravatar-layout">
        <div class="local-vravatar-preview">
            <h3 class="h5">{{#str}}preview, local_vravatar{{/str}}</h3>
            <div class="local-vravatar-stage" id="local-vravatar-stage" data-region="stage">
                <canvas class="local-vravatar-canvas" data-region="canvas" tabindex="0" role="img"
                    aria-label="{{#str}}previewlabel, local_vravatar{{/str}}"
                    aria-describedby="local-vravatar-previewhelp" hidden></canvas>
                <p class="local-vravatar-fallback" data-region="fallback">{{#str}}previewunavailable, local_vravatar{{/str}}</p>
            </div>
            <p class="small text-muted" id="local-vravatar-previewhelp" data-region="previewhelp" hidden>
                {{#str}}previewhelp, local_vravatar{{/str}}
            </p>
            <div class="local-vravatar-previewbuttons">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-action="zoom" aria-controls="local-vravatar-stage"
                    aria-pressed="false" hidden>{{#str}}showwhole, local_vravatar{{/str}}</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-action="camera" aria-pressed="false" hidden>
                    {{#str}}camerapreview, local_vravatar{{/str}}
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="local-vravatar-choices">
            <form method="post" action="{{actionurl}}" data-region="form">
                <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save">
                {{#sections}}
                    <section class="local-vravatar-section" aria-labelledby="{{id}}">
                        <h3 class="h5 local-vravatar-section-heading" id="{{id}}">{{heading}}</h3>
                        {{#items}}
                            {{#radio}}
                                <fieldset class="local-vravatar-group{{#isswatch}} local-vravatar-swatches{{/isswatch}}" id="{{id}}">
                                    <legend class="h6">{{legend}}</legend>
                                    {{#options}}
                                        <div class="form-check form-check-inline local-vravatar-option">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}" id="{{id}}"
                                                {{#model}}data-model="{{model}}"{{/model}} {{#checked}}checked{{/checked}}>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="{{id}}">
                                                {{#swatch}}
                                                    <span class="local-vravatar-swatch" data-swatch="{{value}}" data-palette="{{palette}}"
                                                        style="background-color: {{swatch}};" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                                {{/swatch}}
                                                {{label}}
                                                {{#credit}}<span class="local-vravatar-credit">{{credit}}</span>{{/credit}}
                                            </label>
                                        </div>
                                    {{/options}}
                                </fieldset>
                            {{/radio}}
                            {{#costume}}
                                <fieldset class="local-vravatar-group local-vravatar-costumes" id="{{id}}"
                                    aria-describedby="local-vravatar-outfit-help">
                                    <legend class="h6">{{legend}}</legend>
                                    <p class="form-text text-muted" id="local-vravatar-outfit-help">{{#str}}outfit_help, local_vravatar{{/str}}</p>
                                    {{#none}}
                                        <div class="form-check local-vravatar-option">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}" id="{{id}}"
                                                {{#checked}}checked{{/checked}}>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="{{id}}">{{label}}</label>
                                        </div>
                                    {{/none}}
                                    {{#categories}}
                                        <fieldset class="local-vravatar-costumecategory" id="{{id}}">
                                            <legend class="local-vravatar-costumelegend">{{legend}}</legend>
                                            <div class="local-vravatar-costumegrid">
                                                {{#options}}
                                                    <div class="local-vravatar-costume">
                                                        <input class="local-vravatar-costume-input" type="radio" name="outfit"
                                                            value="{{value}}" id="{{id}}" data-model="{{model}}" data-kind="{{kind}}"
                                                            {{#checked}}checked{{/checked}}>
                                                        <label class="local-vravatar-costume-label" for="{{id}}">
                                                            <img class="local-vravatar-costume-thumb" src="{{thumb}}" alt="" width="96" height="96"
                                                                loading="lazy">
                                                            <span class="local-vravatar-costume-name">{{label}}</span>
                                                            {{#credit}}<span class="local-vravatar-credit">{{credit}}</span>{{/credit}}
                                                        </label>
                                                    </div>
                                                {{/options}}
                                            </div>
                                        </fieldset>
                                    {{/categories}}
                                </fieldset>
                                {{#hascredits}}
                                    <details class="local-vravatar-credits">
                                        <summary>{{#str}}costumecredits, local_vravatar{{/str}}</summary>
                                        <ul class="small">
                                            {{#credits}}
                                                <li>{{name}}: <a href="{{source}}">{{title}}</a> {{credit}}</li>
                                            {{/credits}}
                                        </ul>
                                    </details>
                                {{/hascredits}}
                            {{/costume}}
                            {{#check}}
                                <fieldset class="local-vravatar-group" id="{{groupid}}">
                                    <legend class="h6">{{legend}}</legend>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="{{name}}" value="1" id="{{id}}"
                                            {{#checked}}checked{{/checked}}>
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="{{id}}">{{label}}</label>
                                    </div>
                                </fieldset>
                            {{/check}}
                        {{/items}}
                        {{#isextras}}
                            <fieldset class="local-vravatar-group" id="local-vravatar-group-extras">
                                <legend class="h6">{{#str}}glassespicture, local_vravatar{{/str}}</legend>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="glasses" value="1" id="local-vravatar-glasses"
                                        {{#glasses}}checked{{/glasses}}>
                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="local-vravatar-glasses">{{#str}}glasses, local_vravatar{{/str}}</label>
                                </div>
                                {{#pictureallowed}}
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="picture" value="1" id="local-vravatar-picture"
                                            aria-describedby="local-vravatar-picture-help" {{#picture}}checked{{/picture}}>
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="local-vravatar-picture">{{#str}}picture, local_vravatar{{/str}}</label>
                                        <div class="form-text text-muted" id="local-vravatar-picture-help">
                                            {{#str}}picture_help, local_vravatar{{/str}}
                                            {{^haspicture}}{{#str}}picturenone, local_vravatar{{/str}}{{/haspicture}}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                {{/pictureallowed}}
                                {{^pictureallowed}}
                                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">{{#str}}picturedisabled, local_vravatar{{/str}}</p>
                                {{/pictureallowed}}
                            </fieldset>
                        {{/isextras}}
                    </section>
                {{/sections}}

                <div class="local-vravatar-buttons">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="save">{{#str}}save, local_vravatar{{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="reset" hidden>{{#str}}reset, local_vravatar{{/str}}</button>
                </div>
                <p class="local-vravatar-status" data-region="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </form>

            <form method="post" action="{{actionurl}}" data-region="removeform"{{^hasdesign}} hidden{{/hasdesign}}>
                <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                <input type="hidden" name="action" value="remove">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-link px-0">{{#str}}remove, local_vravatar{{/str}}</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
